new
domain extent -10 10

wall generate ...
    group boxes ...
    id 1 ...
    name box1 ...
    box -5.0 5.0 ;onewall ;注意onewall的作用

pause key

wall delete facets range id 1

pause key

wall delete range id 2 by facet

pause key

wall delete walls range id 3

pause key

wall delete range id 4 by wall